### Issue 1 — Dark callout boxes inside lesson content (HIGH PRIORITY)

The markdown renderer still applies old dark CSS to the custom callout/box classes.
Three specific block types are afflicted:

| Class | Current | Should Be |
|-------|---------|-----------|
| `.cp-definition` (blue key-concept boxes) | **Dark navy `#0f172a`** background | Soft blue tint: `#eff6ff` bg, `#1e3a5f` text |
| `.cp-warning` (warning boxes) | **Dark near-black with red border** | Soft amber: `#fffbeb` bg, `#92400e` text |
| `.cp-note` / `.cp-tip` | **Dark navy** | Soft yellow/green tint |

> These are defined in `App.css` from the original dark theme. The fix is targeted CSS overrides.

