### Issue 2 — Practice Problem accordions (HIGH PRIORITY)

The `<details><summary>` practice blocks (🧩 Practice 1, etc.) render with a **solid dark navy header** (`#0f172a` or similar). In the light theme this is jarring — it looks like a broken component.

> The fix is adding light-theme styles for `details` and `summary` in `App.css`.

